# Self-hosted build: everything is served from one origin by the FastAPI
# backend, so both of these stay EMPTY on purpose.
#
# VITE_API_URL empty  -> /api/* stays relative, hitting the same host.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL empty -> src/lib/supabase.js falls back to
#   window.location.origin + '/supabase', which the backend proxies to the
#   local stack. Resolved in the browser at runtime, so the same build works
#   behind any hostname — including a tunnel URL that changes on restart.
VITE_API_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_ACJWlzQHlZjBrEguHvfOxg_3BJgxAaH
